WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.120
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an Indian survival drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:19.360
called “Trapped”. Watch out and take care!
Shaurya is a call centre employee living in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:25.440
Mumbai, India. He has had a crush on his&nbsp;
co-worker Noorie for a long time. One day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:31.200
he gathers enough courage to call her but is too&nbsp;
shy to express his feelings. But starting that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:37.520
day, he calls her daily and engages in an awkward&nbsp;
conversation that Noorie seems to enjoy. She loves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:42.880
to flirt with Shaurya and get him nervous but is&nbsp;
annoyed at the fact that he never asks her out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.760
When he calls her the next time she asks him&nbsp;
to guess her favourite food in five seconds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:51.520
If he guesses right she will go&nbsp;
out with him but if it is wrong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:56.800
she will stop picking up his calls. Although&nbsp;
nervous, Shaurya guesses it correctly and lands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.720
a date with her. That evening, they go to a street&nbsp;
vendor to eat her favourite food. Sometime later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:07.680
they are in a restaurant talking about different&nbsp;
things when Noorie casually mentions that she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:13.440
getting married in two months. A surprised Shaurya&nbsp;
asks her if her marriage has been arranged by her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:18.480
parents. When she affirms he continues&nbsp;
the conversation, ignoring the topic.
&nbsp;

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:24.080
That day marks the beginning of their friendship.&nbsp;
Noorie starts to look forward to meeting him and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:29.440
hardly pays attention to work. They go on several&nbsp;
dates and start falling in love with each other.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:34.560
One day, Shaurya brings her to his apartment&nbsp;
that he shares with three of his roommates.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:41.120
They lock themselves in his room and start making&nbsp;
out. Noorie stops abruptly and is visibly upset&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.640
thinking about their future. Shaurya asks her to&nbsp;
cancel the wedding and elope with him. At first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:51.760
she thinks he is joking but starts to consider&nbsp;
it when he insists. When she says that she cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:57.040
live with his roommate, he promises to find a&nbsp;
new apartment by tomorrow and move in with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:02.160
Her wedding is in only two days so they will&nbsp;
have to be quick. Right after she leaves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.880
Shaurya calls several dealers to look for an&nbsp;
appropriate apartment. However, because of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:12.000
timing and low budget, he doesn’t get any.&nbsp;
He spends the entire day visiting apartment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:18.080
complexes with little to no progress. In one of&nbsp;
such meetings, a stranger hears him talk about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:23.600
wanting an affordable place. He approaches Shrauya&nbsp;
saying that he has a perfect place for him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.880
Shaurya is skeptical at first but he agrees to&nbsp;
come to have a look at the apartment anyway. 
&nbsp;

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:34.320
He is brought to a newly built high-rise apartment&nbsp;
complex that seems to be way more expensive than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:39.920
what he can afford. He is told that the complex&nbsp;
was built two years ago but is empty due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.960
construction and legal issues. The apartment&nbsp;
that he is being offered belongs to a man who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:50.320
hardly ever comes to that place. The stranger&nbsp;
he just met is only a caretaker of the place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:55.280
but since the owner has been absent for two&nbsp;
years, he is unethically handing it to Shaurya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:59.520
for money. The couple will be the only&nbsp;
people living in the massive building&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:05.040
which unsettles Shaurya. But when he gets a&nbsp;
look at the apartment, he forgets about all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:11.120
sketchy things related to it. It is massive with&nbsp;
a bedroom, a kitchen, a living area, a bathroom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:17.200
and a fenced balcony. The place is clearly worth&nbsp;
way more than the price he is paying. He finalizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.720
the deal and gets the keys to the place. Following&nbsp;
that, he packs up his luggage from his old place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:27.920
but doesn't tell his roommates about his plans to&nbsp;
elope. He simply claims that he is going home for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:38.000
a few days and leaves. At his new apartment, he&nbsp;
lays down a mattress, cleans the room a little,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:44.480
and falls asleep, hoping to surprise Noorie the&nbsp;
next day. He has put his phone to charge but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:50.080
power cuts off. The following morning, he wakes&nbsp;
up late and quickly does his morning routine. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:55.200
further notices that none of the taps are working&nbsp;
and uses bottled water to brush his teeth. 
&nbsp;

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:59.280
After some minutes he finally steps out&nbsp;
of the apartment and locks it. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:04.480
he has to run inside again to get his phone. He&nbsp;
forgets to get the keys and accidentally locks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:10.320
himself inside. Noorie calls him and asks him why&nbsp;
he is late. Shaurya explains that he will be there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:19.040
in a few minutes but doesn’t tell her where he&nbsp;
is to keep it a surprise. When the call ends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:24.720
and he tries to get out, he realises that he is&nbsp;
in trouble. He forcefully tries to open the lock&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:30.560
but fails. He finds some tools in the drawers and&nbsp;
uses them but without the keys, opening it seems&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:35.840
almost impossible. Following that, he calls a&nbsp;
helpline asking them to send someone to break&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:41.600
the lock. But to his misfortune, his phone dies&nbsp;
before he can tell them the address. He tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:47.040
charge it again but the power outage only makes&nbsp;
it difficult. Shaurya gets more irritated with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:53.200
time and starts to bang the door to break it but&nbsp;
is unsuccessful yet again. Moreover, he hurts his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:58.880
hand in the process. Moments later, he comes to&nbsp;
the balcony and calls the watchman who cannot hear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:03.680
him because of the noise of the traffic and the&nbsp;
height. Shaurya finally registers that he is stuck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:08.320
in the apartment. His plan to elope with&nbsp;
Noorie has failed because she will probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:13.120
think he has run away afraid of commitment. 
He cleans the wound with the little bottled water&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:18.160
he has left. In hopes of charging his phone’s&nbsp;
battery, he keeps it out in the sun but it does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:24.160
nothing. Following that, he continues shouting for&nbsp;
help. Hours pass but no one hears him. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:29.360
he eats a packet of biscuits and falls asleep.&nbsp;
When he wakes up the next morning, the power is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:34.160
still out and the taps aren’t working either. He&nbsp;
yet again tries to open the door with everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:39.840
he has in the house. Even after throwing a chair&nbsp;
and a fan at it, it doesn’t budge. Shaurya is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:46.640
now ready to take extreme measures to get out. He&nbsp;
unplugs the TV mounted on the wall and throws it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:52.560
off the balcony. It lands below with a loud bang,&nbsp;
but the watchman still doesn’t notice it. Later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:57.840
he eats away all the biscuits and is left with&nbsp;
little to no water. He notices several pieces of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:03.760
cardboard on top of the kitchen shelf and thinks&nbsp;
of a plan. Using his toothpaste, he writes “help”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:09.120
and the name of the building on them and drops&nbsp;
it off the balcony. To his dismay, the cardboard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:16.640
lands on someone’s roof where no one is going to&nbsp;
find it. Shaurya doesn’t lose hope and does the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:21.680
same with another piece of cardboard that lands&nbsp;
on another building’s roof. When he runs out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:28.080
toothpaste, he uses his blood to write the message&nbsp;
and drops two more cardboards off the balcony. One&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:32.880
of them lands directly below the building while&nbsp;
the other one lands on someone’s terrace. 
&nbsp;

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:37.840
He stays on the balcony waiting for someone&nbsp;
to find them and look for him. In the evening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:42.960
a woman comes to the terrace to pick up clothes&nbsp;
that had been drying in the sun. Shaurya gets up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:47.520
and starts yelling at her but is disappointed&nbsp;
when she doesn’t notice the cardboard.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:53.360
At night he goes to the kitchen and sees that he&nbsp;
is completely out of food. He also notices a rat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:58.240
on the floor and is terrified. While trying to&nbsp;
run away from it, he hits his head on the wall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:07.200
and falls unconscious. The next morning he wakes&nbsp;
up still on the floor. He sees that the tap in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:13.120
the kitchen sink is working but he is too scared&nbsp;
to go inside because of the rat. Soon, it runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:19.120
out of water and he is left disappointed. He had&nbsp;
broken his glasses last night that he fixes with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:24.880
pyjama string. In another attempt to make someone&nbsp;
see him, he builds a makeshift sling shot and uses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:29.600
it to launch pebbles at the woman on the top of&nbsp;
the roof. The pebbles catch her attention but she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:36.240
ignores them after seeing no one around. Another&nbsp;
day passes in a similar way. At night, Shaurya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:42.080
uses his clothes to write help on the balcony’s&nbsp;
bar and starts banging the bars with a pan. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:47.440
does it till the morning but no one hears him. The&nbsp;
watchman finally finds the cardboard he had thrown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:53.200
but the guy cannot read so he ignores it. 
Later, the woman from the nearby house also finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:58.560
the cardboard. She looks around but cannot see&nbsp;
Shaurya from that height. He yells for help trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:03.760
to get her attention and is overjoyed when he sees&nbsp;
her coming to the apartment complex. The woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:09.040
asks the watchman if anyone stays there. The man&nbsp;
claims that he has worked there for two years and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:15.360
is sure no one is in the building. The woman is&nbsp;
still not satisfied so she goes up several floors.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:21.120
However, the empty place spooks her out so she&nbsp;
returns home. Shaurya sees her leaving and loses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:26.640
the speck of hope he had. When it turns dark,&nbsp;
he burns the clothes that were hung in the bars.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:31.840
When that starts to blow out, he also lights&nbsp;
the mattress on fire. He jumps up and down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:37.280
sure that the fire is bound to get someone’s&nbsp;
attention. However, the plan goes wrong when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:43.600
the fire spreads to a couch. He somehow blows it&nbsp;
out with his vest and falls asleep. Out of hunger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:49.280
he dreams of eating his favourite meal with Noorie&nbsp;
like they used to. He also remembers the survival&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:54.400
shows that teach to eat anything one gets when&nbsp;
they are deserted. Taking the advice, he goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.400 --> 00:09:00.080
to the kitchen to kill the rat but freaks out when&nbsp;
it runs towards him. The next day, thirst gets the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:06.720
best of him. So, he reluctantly pees on the pan&nbsp;
and drinks it. However, the taste makes him vomit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:12.720
right after. He spends the entire day sleeping and&nbsp;
wakes up the next morning to heavy rainfall. 
&nbsp;

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:17.200
Shaurya quickly collects water in the pan and&nbsp;
drinks from it. He also uses everything that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:21.920
a container to collect as much water as he&nbsp;
can, including the fridge, the flush tank,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:27.360
and the paint cans. The next morning, a pigeon&nbsp;
lands on the balcony. With his only chance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:32.800
Shaurya uses the slingshot to kill it and use&nbsp;
it as food. However, when he tries to skin it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:37.600
he is disgusted. A flashback shows us the&nbsp;
time he and Noorie were out on a date.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:42.960
Shaurya, who has been a vegetarian his entire&nbsp;
life argues that killing helpless animals for food&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:48.400
is unethical. Back in the present, he reluctantly&nbsp;
cuts the bird’s head off and roasts it. He also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:54.000
gets over his fear of rats and manages to trap it.&nbsp;
When the isolation takes the best of him, he talks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:59.040
to the rat about all the ways he can escape. He&nbsp;
has seen that an apartment some floors below him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:04.000
doesn’t have bars on the balcony. If he manages&nbsp;
to get to the apartment and the door is open,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:09.920
he could walk right out of it. However, for that,&nbsp;
he has to cut the bars off his balcony first.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:15.760
The only tool he has is a metal sheet but he&nbsp;
starts sawing it anyway. Several days pass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:21.920
but he doesn’t give up trying to cut it. He feeds&nbsp;
on ants, cockroaches, and occasional birds. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:27.040
things get tough, he starts to miss little things&nbsp;
he used to dread like getting pushed by sweaty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:35.280
people on the bus. After many days of sawing,&nbsp;
and burning the railing, it finally breaks. 
&nbsp;

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:40.480
Shaurya takes the chance and carefully climbs down&nbsp;
the bars of three floors. When he finally gets to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:46.480
the one with no bars, his legs are too short to&nbsp;
climb in. He uses his belt for support and finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:51.920
gets inside it. With much courage, he pulls the&nbsp;
door to the apartment and is overjoyed when it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:57.840
happens to be open. He climbs down the stairs&nbsp;
and finally makes eye contact with the watchman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:03.840
He has a hundred things he wants to say to him but&nbsp;
he simply walks away. A week later, Noorie comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:09.040
to visit him in the hospital. She believed that he&nbsp;
had abandoned her and has already gotten married.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.920
He tries to hold her hand but she moves it,&nbsp;
knowing that they cannot be together now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:19.520
Some days later, Shaurya returns to work but is&nbsp;
shattered to see that his friends and colleagues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:24.640
had not even noticed his absence. Later that&nbsp;
day, he goes to his favourite restaurant and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:30.480
enjoys his favourite food that he missed dearly.&nbsp;
In the last scene, he returns to the apartment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:39.040
and looks at the broken bar. 
